{"route":"/docs/4.2/utilities/embed/","version":"4.2","renderedVersion":"4.2","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Embeds","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Create responsive video or slideshow embeds based on the width of the parent by creating an intrinsic ratio that scales on any device."},"blocks":[{"id":"about","type":"heading","en":"About","level":2},{"id":"about--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Rules are directly applied to <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;embed&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;video&gt;</code>, and <code>&lt;object&gt;</code> elements; optionally use an explicit descendant class <code>.embed-responsive-item</code> when you want to match the styling for other attributes."},{"id":"about--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<strong>Pro-Tip!</strong> You don’t need to include <code>frameborder=&quot;0&quot;</code> in your <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code>s as we override that for you."},{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Wrap any embed like an <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code> in a parent element with <code>.embed-responsive</code> and an aspect ratio. The <code>.embed-responsive-item</code> isn’t strictly required, but we encourage it."},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"f48a3836dae99291a600","height":147},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9\">\n  <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zpOULjyy-n8?rel=0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"aspect-ratios","type":"heading","en":"Aspect ratios","level":2},{"id":"aspect-ratios--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Aspect ratios can be customized with modifier classes. By default the following ratio classes are provided:"},{"id":"aspect-ratios--code-1","type":"code","value":"<!-- 21:9 aspect ratio -->\n<div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-21by9\">\n  <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"...\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 16:9 aspect ratio -->\n<div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9\">\n  <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"...\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 4:3 aspect ratio -->\n<div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-4by3\">\n  <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"...\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 1:1 aspect ratio -->\n<div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-1by1\">\n  <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"...\"></iframe>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"aspect-ratios--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Within <code>_variables.scss</code>, you can change the aspect ratios you want to use. Here’s an example of the <code>$embed-responsive-aspect-ratios</code> list:"},{"id":"aspect-ratios--code-2","type":"code","value":"$embed-responsive-aspect-ratios: (\n  (21 9),\n  (16 9),\n  (3 4),\n  (1 1)\n) !default;","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"f48a3836dae99291a600","html":"\n<div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9\">\n  <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zpOULjyy-n8?rel=0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Theming","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/theming/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.2/getting-started/build-